X: 1
T: Sing My Tongue, The Glorious Battle
T: (also known as Sing My Tongue the Savior's Battle)
C: Words:  Venantius Fortunatus, 569.  Translated by John M. Neale, 1851.
C: Music: 'Pange Lingua', Proper Sarum Melody, alt.  Setting: "The Church Hymnal, Revised and Enlarged" (Episcopal), 1898, alt.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2025 Revision.
S: Music source: "The Church Hymnal, Revised and Enlarged" (Episcopal), 1898 Hymn 98, alt.  Alterations by Brian Dumont, 03 Nov 2025.  All alterations released into the public domain.
S: Lyrics Source: "Mediæval Hymns" by John Mason Neale, 1851 pg 1-4
M: none % time signature
L: 1/4 % default length
